@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "Server" as S
participant "Broadcast (All Clients)" as B

== FinalScoringState Entry ==

note over S: onEntry(): notifyPhaseObservers(END_GAME) before onEntryActions()
loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver) — e.g. end-game prestige bonuses
    S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
end
note right S: No notifyPhaseChanged(END_GAME) is emitted.

== Final Score Calculation ==

note over S: calculateFinalScores()\n(sums PP from Builders / Buildings / Inventors / Artists — internal update, no per-player notifications)\ndetermineWinner()
note right S: The breakdown is included in finalRankings.

S ->> B: notifyGameEnded(winners: List<String>, finalRankings: List<PlayerFinalScore>)

note over S #Red: logGameEnded() + close() + shutdown()\nGame Ended
@enduml